<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%-include('partials/head.ejs');%>
    <%-include('partials/style.ejs');%>
    <title><%=title%></title>
</head>
<body>
    <%-include('partials/nav.ejs');%>
    <div class="container mt-4 content">
        <h1>Our Services</h1>
        <div class="card mt-2">
            <div class="card-body">
                At Healthy Fruits and Veggies API, we provide a comprehensive database of fruits and vegetables, offering detailed nutritional insights and health suitability information to help individuals make informed dietary choices.
            </div>
        </div>

        <h4 class="mt-4 mb-3">What We Offer </h4>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <ul class="list-group">
                    <li class="list-group-item">✅ Fruits & Vegetables Data – Access a wide range of fruits and vegetables with complete details.</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">✅ Nutritional Breakdown – Get per 100g serving information on:</li>
                </ul>
                <ul class="mt-2">
                    <li><code style="color: black;">Calories</code></li>
                    <li><code style="color: black;">Protein</code></li>
                    <li><code style="color: black;">Carbohydrates</code></li>
                    <li><code style="color: black;">Sugar</code></li>
                    <li><code style="color: black;">Fiber</code></li>
                    <li><code style="color: black;">Saturated Fat</code></li>
                    <li><code style="color: black;">Total Fat</code></li>
                </ul>
                <ul class="list-group">
                    <li class="list-group-item">✅ Health Suitability – Know if an item is good for:</li>
                </ul>
                <ul class="mt-2">
                    <li><code style="color: black;">Diabetes (Sugar Patients)</code></li>
                    <li><code style="color: black;">High Blood Pressure Patients</code></li>
                    <li><code style="color: black;">Uric Acid Patients</code></li>
                </ul>
                <ul class="list-group">
                    <li class="list-group-item">✅ Origin Countries – Learn where each fruit or vegetable is commonly grown.</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">✅ Regional Names – Find alternative names in different languages and cultures.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-4 bg-color bg-dark">
        <div class="container text-light text-center">
            <!-- <p class="display-5 mb-3">9iNe</p> -->
            <small class="text-white-50">&copy; Copyright by 9iNe. All rights reserved.</small>
        </div>
    </footer>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script>
        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {
            const currentPage = window.location.pathname;
            const navLinks = document.querySelectorAll(".navbar .nav-link");
      
            navLinks.forEach(link => {
                if (link.getAttribute("href") === currentPage) {
                    link.classList.add("active");
                } else {
                    link.classList.remove("active");
                }
            });
        });
      </script>
       <style>
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container { padding: 10px; }
            .table-responsive { overflow-x: auto; }
            footer { padding: 10px; }
            .navbar { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
            .navbar-nav { text-align: center; }
            .navbar .nav-link { display: block; padding: 10px; }
        }
    </style>
</body>
</html>
